{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghCTMZG319dyb7iN5Z2z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01L8A9rcekThzn5RhCZFXtGW","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/95-main.js'; s=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"  ['Surveying the circuits', () => { for (const id of SN.TRACK_ORDER) SN.getTrack(id); }],\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"  ['Surveying the circuits', () => { if (!HUBON) for (const id of SN.TRACK_ORDER) SN.getTrack(id); }],   // (a session builds only its event's circuit)\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nold2=\"\"\"    tw = R3.trackWorld(H.event.track); race = H.makeRace(tw); R3.attach(tw, race); cfg = { mode: 'hub' };\"\"\"\nnew2=\"\"\"    // ready as soon as the world and the race exist; the shaders build during the card (the race starts after it)\n    tw = R3.trackWorld(H.event.track); race = H.makeRace(tw); R3.attach(tw, race, { prepare: false }); cfg = { mode: 'hub' }; this.prepT = 0;\"\"\"\nassert old2 in s; s=s.replace(old2,new2)\nold3=\"\"\"    if (!H.started) {\n      H.cardInput(I, game.r);\"\"\"\nnew3=\"\"\"    if (!H.started) {\n      if (!tw._prepared && (this.prepT = (this.prepT || 0) + dt) > .1 && tw.world) { tw.world.prepare(); tw._prepared = true; }\n      H.cardInput(I, game.r);\"\"\"\nassert old3 in s; s=s.replace(old3,new3)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/60-render.js'; s=open(p).read()\nold4=\"\"\"R.attach = (tw, race) => {\"\"\"\nnew4=\"\"\"R.attach = (tw, race, o = {}) => {\"\"\"\nassert old4 in s; s=s.replace(old4,new4)\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"  if (!tw._prepared) { tw.world.prepare(); tw._prepared = true; }\n};\"\"\",\"\"\"  if (!tw._prepared && o.prepare !== false) { tw.world.prepare(); tw._prepared = true; }\n};\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nEOF\ngrep -n \"o.prepare !== false\" src/60-render.js | head -2; TMPDIR=$PWD/.tmp timeout 900 node tests/run.mjs hub 2>&1 | tail -3","description":"Make sessions ready sooner and rerun the hub mock","tim